      "id": "warlord_doctrine_toll",
      "display_name": "The Toll",
      "description": "The boom is up and the price is known, same as last week, same as next week, higher if you make it higher. The Tollman collects on schedule, files the chits, and lets the road do the arguing. Tribute is not cruelty; it is bookkeeping with teeth. The collector calls once a week, and the collector knows your face.",
